<section class="container narrow inner-section"><p class="eyebrow">WHAT WE CARE ABOUT</p><h2>Close to the source.<br>Close to home.</h2><p>Our fictional bakery favors flour with a story, seasonal ingredients and a short menu made with care. We would work with nearby mills and growers whenever supply allows, and tell you when something changes.</p><p>Small batches help us bake thoughtfully. Yesterday’s loaf becomes today’s toast; surplus planning begins before the first dough is mixed.</p></section>
